=== Text #14 ===
> The Fellowship[ pairs a] select number of highly skilled young professionals with leading NGOs and social enterprises[ in] India in[ order to accelerate] impact and create effective projects[ that] are replicable, scalable, and sustainable. Through ten months[ of] service and fieldwork, Fellows gain knowledge of development[ on the] ground in the fields of education, livelihoods, public[ health], and social enterprise[,] honing and[ harness]ing their growing skills[ as] change agents[ capable of] effecting lasting change.
[Applicants] must[ be] a citizen / permanent resident of the United States or citizen of India and[ between the] ages of 21 and 34 in[ September of the year of] application. Applic[ants must] have also completed an undergraduate degree[ prior to] September 1st[ in the year of application].

